Package: aimlsptm
Title: Tools for Spatio-Temporal Agricultural Experimental Design
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Lunganlung", "P G", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "lunganlungpg@gmail.com")
Description: Research infrastructure and baseline randomization tools for
    AI/ML guided spatio-temporal agricultural field experiments. Implements
    resolvable incomplete-block layouts and observation schedule enumeration.
    Advanced allocation and inference methods remain under development.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
